0.01   = Verlet:      Verlet distance for optimization
linear  = contact law  Contact law, right now only hertz and linear
0       = RenderVideo: 1 if video should be render, 0 otherwise
1.0e6 = Kn:          Normal stiffness
1.0e6  = Kt:          Tangential stiffness
190.9859    = Gn:          Normal dissipative coefficient
54.5674 = Gt:          Tangential dissipative coefficient
0.1   = Mu0:         Microscopic friction coefficient
1 = rho;
0.5 = Radius;
6 = num cells
1e-5   = dt:          Time step
1e-2 =           dtOut:       Time step for output
100 = target p
0.02 = gain
1e-5 = limit inertia
2 = final time
